window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>A disability becomes a superpower.</b></p> <p>Chase Madison’s struggles with mental illness have turned jail cells into a revolving door. His latest arrest seems like just another spin in the cycle—until he uncovers a shocking conspiracy that offers him a chance at redemption.</p> <p>While in custody, he discovers a clandestine group with the power to manipulate people and events using a mysterious mental force called Psy. They take an interest in Chase because of his unique resistance to it—only to realize that <b>his mental disorder</b> is what makes him immune.</p> <p>Determined to expose the truth, Chase calls upon the skills of his criminal past to peel back the layers of their organization—only to uncover a leader whose ambitions threaten the entire world. He tries to walk away, but an unexpected connection with a defector changes his mind. She believes in him. She shows him that his brokenness may just be his greatest strength.</p>"; 
